<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.RotLookAt(Rotation: rotation, Strength: number, Damping: number)`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llRotLookAt(rotation Rotation, float Strength, float Damping);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Causes an object to smoothly rotate to <b>target_direction</b> with <b>strength</b> resistance at <b>damping</b> force.</p>
  <p>Maintains rotation <b>target_direction</b> until stopped with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlStopLookAt" target="_blank">llStopLookAt</a>.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>rotation</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>rotation</span></td>
          <td>Rotation / target_direction</td>
          <td></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
